Behaviour, field layout and error texts are ported from CPython Lib/zipfile (Python Software Foundation License 2.0, see LICENSE-python).

src/deflate/deflate.mojo is a port of the DEFLATE algorithm of zlib 1.3.2 (deflate.c, trees.c): the hash-chain match search,
lazy matching, per-level configuration table, block splitting and Huffman tree construction are zlib's, line by line, so that
the output bytes equal zlib's. zlib is Copyright (C) 1995-2026 Jean-loup Gailly and Mark Adler, under the zlib licence
(see LICENSE-zlib). src/deflate/inflate.mojo and crc32.mojo are original code to the same RFC 1951 / IEEE definitions;
inflate reuses zlib's error texts.
